title: "Data flow - persisted preferences (read path and write path)"
---
flowchart TB
  classDef source fill:#eceff1,stroke:#455a64,color:#263238
  classDef data fill:#cfd8dc,stroke:#37474f,color:#263238
  classDef domainPkg fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
  classDef vm fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,color:#e65100
  classDef view fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d47a1

  subgraph READ["READ PATH - source to screen (reactive, Flow)"]
    direction TB
    R1["Disk: files/datastore/<br/>user-preferences | stream-preferences<br/>Base64 of AES-CBC ciphertext"]
    R2["EncryptedPreferencesSerializer.readFrom()<br/>Base64 decode - KeystoreCryptoEngine.decrypt - JSON decode<br/>any failure returns defaultValue"]
    R3["DataStoreManager / StreamPreferencesDataStoreManager<br/>exposes dataStore.data as Flow"]
    R4["UserPreferencesRepositoryImpl / StreamPreferencesRepositoryImpl<br/>@Singleton, bound via Hilt @Binds<br/>StreamPreferences impl logs and rethrows read failures"]
    R5["Use cases<br/>GetStreamPreferencesUseCase: map { reconciled() } + catch -> empty<br/>GetVpnConfigStatusUseCase: map to VpnCredentialsStatus<br/>GetVpnConfigUseCase: first() + toVpnConfigOrNull()"]
    R6["ViewModel<br/>combine(...).stateIn(viewModelScope, Eagerly)<br/>-> HomeUiState / ConfigUiState / StreamURLsUiState"]
    R7["Composable Route<br/>collectAsStateWithLifecycle() -> recomposition"]
    R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4 --> R5 --> R6 --> R7
  end

  subgraph WRITE["WRITE PATH - user action to disk"]
    direction TB
    W1["User action in a Composable<br/>(add URL, remove, load defaults, save,<br/>drag and drop reorder, scan QR code)"]
    W2["ViewModel method<br/>onAddUrlConfirmed / onSaveUrlsConfirmed /<br/>onSaveGridConfirmed / onStreamsReordered /<br/>onQrCodeScanned"]
    W3["Validation before persisting<br/>validateStreamUrl() - core.storage.domain<br/>validateGridPreferences() - feature.streamurls.logic<br/>ParseUserPreferencesFromQrCodeUseCase"]
    W4["Use case returns Result<br/>SaveStreamUrlsUseCase | SaveGridPreferencesUseCase<br/>UpdateStreamOrderUseCase | SaveUserPreferencesUseCase"]
    W5["Repository.updateStreamPreferences { current -> ... }<br/>transform receives the value persisted at write time,<br/>so each use case rewrites only its own scope"]
    W6["DataStore.updateData - atomic read/modify/write"]
    W7["EncryptedPreferencesSerializer.writeTo()<br/>JSON encode (encodeDefaults) - AES encrypt - Base64"]
    W8["Disk"]
    W1 --> W2 --> W3 --> W4 --> W5 --> W6 --> W7 --> W8
  end

  W8 -.->|"new value re-emitted on the read Flow:<br/>every collector updates, no manual refresh"| R1
  W4 -.->|"Result.onFailure -> showToast(...)<br/>the UI learns about the failure, the draft is kept"| R6

  Draft["StreamURLs screen exception:<br/>the draft (MutableStateFlow of StreamPreferences) is seeded ONCE with first()<br/>and then owned by the screen. Later storage changes do not overwrite it,<br/>and nothing reaches disk before an explicit Save."]
  Draft -.-> W2

